  aciklama:
  - "Bu se\xE7iminde rengin <color=#6495ED>Peygamber \xC7i\xE7e\u011Fi mavisi</color>.
    S\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n geride kalaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 anlatan rafine
    bir renktir bu. Haks\u0131zl\u0131klar\u0131, u\u011Fursuzluklar\u0131, k\xF6t\xFC
    kalpli ve menfaat\xE7i birtak\u0131m insanlar\u0131 ard\u0131nda b\u0131rakacaks\u0131n
    {{isim}}. \u0130\xE7inde \"{{sayi,2,9}}\" rakam\u0131n\u0131n iki defa ge\xE7ti\u011Fi
    bir tarihte ya\u015Fayaca\u011F\u0131n \xF6nemli bir olay seni kanatland\u0131racak
    ve di\u011Fer her \u015Fey \"yaya\" kalacak."
